    "scenesThatPass": [
      "DENVER: Lonely.\nSETHE: I don't see how it could be lonely spending every minute with us like it does.\nDENVER: It's my sister. She was just a baby when she died in this house.",
      "DENVER: Mama doesn't like talk about Sweet Home. Says it was never sweet and it sure wasn't home.\nSETHE: Girl, mind yourself!",
      "SETHE: That's just it. She got no cause to act up with a stranger.\nSETHE: Baby, what is it? Did something happen?\nDENVER: I can't no more! I can't no more!\nSETHE: Can't what? What can't you?",
      "SETHE: It's the house. People don't...\nDENVER: It's not! It's not the house! It's us! It's you!\nSETHE: Denver!",
      "SETHE: What might your name be?\nBELOVED: Beloved."
    ]
  },
